<QuestionLayout
  title="Can an AI agent call the same capability my app uses, regardless of OS?"
  description="Yes — an MCP-connected agent invokes the same capability and contract your native or browser app calls, through traverse-mcp against the registry, getting identical enforced behavior independent of the host OS."
